          "message": {
            "text": "The pinned Linux records prove the existing generic script handoff fixes this platform without a routing exception. A fresh Noble run selected FreeSans/FreeSerif exactly as Chromium did and emitted the 14 shared-cluster U+25CC streams listed here; the focused production controls in the related test remove the base for a well-formed cluster, a face without nominal U+25CC, and the disabled-cluster mutation.",
            "markdown": "The pinned Linux records prove the existing generic script handoff fixes this platform without a routing exception. A fresh Noble run selected FreeSans/FreeSerif exactly as Chromium did and emitted the 14 shared-cluster U+25CC streams listed here; the focused production controls in the related test remove the base for a well-formed cluster, a face without nominal U+25CC, and the disabled-cluster mutation."
          },
